[Stats]
<H2>~yStats:</H2><P>
Number of Attempts at Trial 1: ~i{TpV1}~. <P>
<H2>~yNotes:</H2><P>
Each ~i1~. represents one unit of measurement. <br>
For example, ~i1 1~. equals two.
$Button=Return to Quest,tell,A.

[END]
